 :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4f6d06be-9e6e-5976-ac37-0dfb6633c901" :question/answer-fields "35043f02-4cbe-5b04-a1e0-7b7a8bf66f1f"] [:db/ensure "4f6d06be-9e6e-5976-ac37-0dfb6633c901" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "4f6d06be-9e6e-5976-ac37-0dfb6633c901"] [:db/add "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f" :answer/id #uuid "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f"] [:db/add "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f" :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(11\\right)-\\ln\\left(8\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520" :answer-field/id #uuid "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520"] [:db/add "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520" :answer-field/choices "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f"] [:db/add "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520" :answer-field/correct "a3a5ef0d-2584-596d-a969-b4816c2e220f"] [:db/ensure "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60" :question/id #uuid "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60"] [:db/add "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{9 e^{x}}{3 e^{x} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{\\ln 3}=3$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 e^{x} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3 e^{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=8\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{9 e^{x}}{3 e^{x} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{8}^{11} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{8}^{11}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\ln{\\left(11 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(8 \\right)}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\ln\\left(11\\right)-\\ln\\left(8\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60" :question/answer-fields "6aada5ef-5b85-585e-acee-e36006fe1520"] [:db/ensure "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "c09871ce-c995-5c32-9eb1-6b8e224d3a60"] [:db/add "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e" :answer/id #uuid "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e"] [:db/add "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e" :answer/value "4\\left(\\ln\\left(4\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885" :answer-field/id #uuid "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885"] [:db/add "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885" :answer-field/choices "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e"] [:db/add "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885" :answer-field/correct "5a764233-b2f3-5e90-b360-28f68e4e845e"] [:db/ensure "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef" :question/id #uuid "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef"] [:db/add "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{\\ln 3}=3$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=e^{x} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=3\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{3}^{4} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{3}^{4}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\ln\\left(4\\right)-\\ln\\left(3\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef" :question/answer-fields "423d8c4d-d609-5dd5-aa88-7aeb5927d885"] [:db/ensure "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "5ed82884-6c8c-5ce4-b237-91d8e5608eef"] [:db/add "5f29c0bd-afd6-595d-a791-b40ce5f73018" :answer/id #uuid "5f29c0bd-afd6-595d-a791-b40ce5f73018"] [:db/add "5f29c0bd-afd6-595d-a791-b40ce5f73018" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5f29c0bd-afd6-595d-a791-b40ce5f73018" :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(12\\right)-\\ln\\left(9\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5f29c0bd-afd6-595d-a791-b40ce5f73018" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fd