n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{e^{x}}{e^{x} + 2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{4}^{5} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{4}^{5}=\\left(\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\ln\\left(5\\right)-\\ln\\left(4\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "f311eb5f-107f-5276-825f-873dacb83ed0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f311eb5f-107f-5276-825f-873dacb83ed0" :question/answer-fields "a76d7558-16bc-538f-bbb9-c370677b70cf"] [:db/ensure "f311eb5f-107f-5276-825f-873dacb83ed0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "f311eb5f-107f-5276-825f-873dacb83ed0"] [:db/add "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10" :answer/id #uuid "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10"] [:db/add "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10" :answer/value "3\\left(\\ln\\left(7\\right)-\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\right)"] [:db/ensure "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/id #uuid "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3"] [:db/add "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/choices "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10"] [:db/add "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/correct "65be0e3e-ffb9-5082-8469-f46219ca3e10"] [:db/ensure "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/id #uuid "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07"] [:db/add "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{6 e^{x}}{2 e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\ln\\left|u\\right|+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $e^{\\ln 2}=2,\\quad e^{\\ln 3}=3$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 e^{x} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{x})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=5\\\\x=\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}&\\Longrightarrow u=7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}^{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}} \\frac{6 e^{x}}{2 e^{x} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{5}^{7} \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\ln\\left|u\\right|\\right]_{5}^{7}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\ln{\\left(7 \\right)}\\right)-\\left(\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\ln\\left(7\\right)-\\ln\\left(5\\right)\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/answer-fields "b2f64048-00f5-5c3b-9ce2-109de29f04b3"] [:db/ensure "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/questions "98ccf776-cbef-59ff-bad2-21baea608c07"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "899f47a9-534d-5b24-8f10-a6a7afb049e1"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/ee/ee9da33b5dfe6b737a0b9d3cdee3ca287b58d1baf4a66ce8dcbf919b38b169f4/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186184352 :knowledge-point/validate]]
